WEBVTT

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.060
What the?!

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:06.940
What in the world...

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:21.000
Seth! Get me out of this thing!

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.000
D-Doc?!

00:01:55.010 --> 00:02:01.010
<b>The Will of the People Shines Bright 
-Resistance-</b>

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:59.380
<i>"The Will of the People Shines Bright."</i>

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:05.810
<i>Nailed it.</i>

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:10.100
<i>On Merlin's name, 
that was an entrance worthy of a knight.</i>

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.900
<i>Where is the enemy?</i>

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.410
<i>Hand over the enemy!</i>

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:14.310
<i>To me, as well!</i>

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:15.400
<i>And to me!</i>

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.400
Wh-What's going on?

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.410
I hear a bunch of different voices.

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:21.450
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:22.580
<i>An enemy?</i>

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:23.970
<i>If so, we must attack!</i>

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:26.160
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.160
He's not!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.400
He's a friend! Seth is a friend!

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:30.430
<i>A subject of the kingdom?</i>

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:32.370
No, not exactly...

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:33.580
<i>Then he is an enemy.</i>

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:35.350
I told you that he's not!

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:37.710
Stop seeing everything 
as either black or white!

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:41.850
Doc, is that you? 
In that awesome armor?

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:45.270
<i>You recognize this awesomeness? 
Not bad, kid.</i>

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:47.570
<i>Say more about it, boy!</i>

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:49.690
Why did this happen?

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.510
<i>A knight is one of high status.</i>

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:54.160
Well... I managed to find 
the memory stones,

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:54.160
<i>Glory to Caislean Merlin!</i>

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.440
<i>Give it to me!</i>

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:57.620
but the soldiers were about to find me, 
so I hid in this armor,

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.880
<i>Hey! Ladies first!</i>

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:58.690
<i>Now, now... I'll take it.</i>

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:59.030
and then <i>this</i> happened!

00:02:58.690 --> 00:02:59.700
<i>No, me first!</i>

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.450
Oh, shut up already!

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:04.620
They keep fighting for control in here, 
and it's driving me mad!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.330
<i>Learn a bit of restraint!</i>

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:07.820
<i>How about this pose?</i>

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.460
<i>Nay! Like this!</i>

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.060
Uh... Uh-huh...

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:13.960
Forgive me for interrupting,

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.820
but I came here for a good slugfest!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:23.460
<i>I see. So you are our enemy.</i>

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:27.970
Imagine that! You stopped 
my projection's attack single-handedly!

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:33.460
You are the heroes of old Caislean 
who inhabit the memory stones, correct?

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:37.610
Who knew you had such an ace 
up your sleeve? How intriguing!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:41.630
<i>Everyone, I suggest we work together 
for the time being.</i>

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:44.450
No, wait! I'm in here!

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.550
<i>We all fight together? I like it!</i>

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:47.910
Listen to me!

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:51.620
<i>On Merlin's name, 
let us fight until our lives are spent!</i>

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:52.620
Uh, you're already dead—

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:53.640
Let's go!

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:54.870
Right!

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:00.760
What awe-inspiring power!

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.760
<i>The attack's working?</i>

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.280
<i>I can't let that arm regenerate!</i>

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:12.290
Skull Burst!

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.950
<i>Not bad, kid.</i>

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:16.020
Right! Now's our chance to retreat!

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.770
<i>On Merlin's name...</i>

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.330
<i>A knight does not flee!</i>

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:20.280
<i>Right!</i>

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.780
You idiots!

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:30.040
Pulsar!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:35.890
<i>Well done!</i>

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.420
<i>You defeated the enemy!</i>

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.970
Great! Let's run! Come on, let's run!

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:42.670
<i>That was too easy. What a letdown.</i>

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:45.670
<i>Well, he was an old man. 
You mustn't blame him.</i>

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:49.390
<i>Aren't there any younger enemies? 
Nice, healthy ones?</i>

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:50.180
Wait.

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:54.210
The bastard fell asleep!

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:55.390
Hey!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.720
Whoops... How silly of me.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.490
How dare you mock us!

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:03.820
Yo! Wasn't this war supposed to end 
once you had me?!

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:09.310
I fought the Brotherhood of Ash 
for seven days and seven nights.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:12.530
Dueled against the great Albur Fendragon...

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:17.710
Pursued the formidable Saroumor 
to the edge of Inlandsis...

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.930
What's he talking about?

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:22.640
But the most excited I've ever been, 
horned sorcerer,

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:26.270
has been during my many battles with you!

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.840
Colonel Santori!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.700
We were trying to put the queen 
in restraints,

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.160
but a huge, tough Knight-sorcerer
 is interfering!

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.970
Who cares about that?

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:35.850
Sir?

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.770
I'm busy right now.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:41.690
You boys will have to 
take care of the queen yourselves!

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:42.530
Yes, sir!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.750
<i>The queen?</i>

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.460
<i>On Merlin's name, we must rescue her!</i>

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:48.300
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:49.370
No, no, no, no!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:50.610
Wait! Hold on!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:50.610
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:52.990
<i>Save the queen!</i>

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:53.290
Wait!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.120
Doc?!

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:01.410
Now it's just the two of us.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.130
Come closer! Come on, now!

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:10.640
Hmm... You seemed much more reckless 
in our previous battles.

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:13.160
What did you mean by all that?

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:16.180
I've never met you anywhere else 
but Rumble Town.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.830
Oh, no, horned sorcerer!

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:21.830
We first met in Vivacyne.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:25.370
What's this? You don't remember?

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:27.820
Well, that hurts!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:31.910
But I suppose you were just a little child, 
and it was only in passing.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.870
A child? Vivacyne?

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:39.120
I lost sight of him in Vivacyne,

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.080
but then I saw <i>him</i>.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:43.900
A guy who looked a lot like me.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.190
You mean Triton?

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:49.880
Did you meet one of my brothers?

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.950
No, I'm certain it was you!

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.870
You had the same face 
and the same tiny horns.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.610
I'm telling you that wasn't me!

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:03.630
Oh? Then could it have been 
a brother of yours, as you say?

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:06.220
That would explain many things.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:07.800
What are you talking about?

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:09.410
I see, I see!

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:11.530
I'm starting to understand now.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:15.870
This means we need 
to capture the lot of you.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:19.000
You and all your brothers!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.250
Quit messing around!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:24.610
Weren't you supposed to end this war 
if Eyepatch brought me here?!

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:26.630
But you're still bombing!

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:30.630
Wonderful! Be more outraged!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:33.890
If I'm your target, 
then I'm the only one you need to aim at!

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:37.730
There are things 
you have no knowledge of.

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:40.390
Things even I don't fully understand.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.580
Huh?!

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:47.620
The only thing I've been told is 
that I am to take all of you into custody.

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:49.170
Into... custody?

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:55.680
You should be honored to have earned 
such favor with General Torque.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:59.420
I'm here only for your sake!

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:03.320
I simply can't help wanting to fight you!

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.330
You're on fire.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.110
Of course I am!

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:10.640
I'm am absolute sucker for a battle, you see!

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:11.970
That's not what I meant.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.420
You're literally on fire.

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:18.510
Yow! That's hot!

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:22.340
What a blunder! 
Now, where did I put my bottles?

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.520
My precious medicine...

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:28.060
Drugs again?

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:30.400
And you guys are happy with that?

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:35.570
Well, the Merchant Barons recommended it.

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:40.430
I don't take any besides this
 counter-Fantasia drug, though.

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:42.540
There's a drug 
for increasing one's strength, too,

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:45.210
but it's a bad one. 
Too easy to get hooked.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.290
Konrad is a bad example of that.

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:52.530
How can you say it's good or bad?

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:55.930
Doesn't it make you feel pathetic 
to rely on that stuff?

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:03.810
On my beard, I have met a great number 
of fools in my life,

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.190
but no one who says 
such foolish things as you!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:14.190
Goodness! You made me use my left arm!

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:16.570
It's been quite a long time 
since I did that!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:21.080
Oh Father of the Inquisition, 
founder of miracles...

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:26.370
Take control over these repulsive ones 
with your greatness!

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:31.710
An old-fashioned high roundhouse kick!

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:43.970
<b>[The Horned Sorcerers] 
Horned sorcerers able to manipulate Fantasia with bare hands 
appear in various parts of Pharenos. The world shakes as they move.</b>

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.670
He's strong.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:55.490
He can't take us all out at once!

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:59.290
I cannot... fall yet...

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.020
Th-That armor...

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.630
The armor of Pen Draig?!

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.960
<i>So this is the current queen?</i>

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:14.230
<i>What a heartbreaking sight.</i>

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:17.130
<i>Unforgivable! Let us destroy them!</i>

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.110
<i>No objections!</i>

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:19.450
<i>No objections!</i>

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:20.220
<i>Then...</i>

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:20.970
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:27.050
<i>Nailed it.</i>

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:29.660
<i>A knight is one of high status!</i>

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:30.560
<i>Child's play!</i>

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:35.940
Could it be... Could it be 
that the great Merlin has sent us help?

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:37.550
Are you...

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:41.650
<i>You have fought well 
to protect your ruler.</i>

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:44.340
<i>We will carry the queen to safety.</i>

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:48.230
Oh! The great Merlin has sent 
one of his followers!

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:51.370
He truly has been watching over us!

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:52.250
<i>Naturally!</i>

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.650
<i>All the time!</i>

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:55.340
<i>Don't doubt it for a moment!</i>

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.980
O-Of course!

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:58.350
Okay, that's enough, right?!

00:10:58.350 --> 00:10:59.730
Let's go back now!

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:02.800
Hm? I've heard that voice 
somewhere before.

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.440
Yeah, it's me!

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:07.450
We met when you tried to hit Ocoho 
with that hammer!

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:12.720
You're the coward from back then?!

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:14.610
You're inside the armor?!

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:15.890
<i>As am I!</i>

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:16.570
<i>And me!</i>

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.400
<i>And me!</i>

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.700
Seriously! They're putting me through hell!

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:22.680
Many Knights-sorcerers have tried,

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.710
but none ever succeeded 
in wearing that armor.

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:27.700
How did you do it?

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:30.730
I was just in the archive 
down below when...

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.460
Uh, never mind! 
Let's get the queen out of here.

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:35.960
Huh? Something cracked?

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.710
What is this?!

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:40.970
What in the world?!

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:43.060
<i>The soldiers have turned to stone?</i>

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.180
<i>What a cruel massacre...</i>

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.810
<i>On Merlin's name, 
there could be nothing more despicable!</i>

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:54.050
I'm lost...

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:58.890
<i>A child? What is a child doing here?</i>

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:00.180
<i>Poor thing.</i>

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:01.610
<i>Come on over here.</i>

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.620
Stop! I don't trust that kid!

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:06.240
<i>You want us to leave a child 
alone on a battlefield?</i>

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.820
<i>Nay! We cannot do that!</i>

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:08.820
Wait, is that child...

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:11.190
Don't let him get close to you!

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:13.000
He's a Thaumaturge!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:17.370
Oh Father of the Inquisition, 
founder of miracles...

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:21.760
With your voice, 
grant these impure ones eternal peace!

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:21.760
<i>Time to fly!</i>

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:28.890
<i>That was close!</i>

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.270
Please exercise utmost caution.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:34.000
Anything that enters that circle 
will turn to stone!

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.650
Just like my leg!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:38.830
He may look like a child, 
but he is a Thaumaturge!

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:41.290
<i>What to do about this?</i>

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.900
I've got a great idea! We can run!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.310
If we run as hard as we can, 
he'll tire out!

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:48.410
Then we can run far, far away!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.060
<i>But a knight...</i>

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:52.430
<i>...cannot show his back to an enemy!</i>

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:53.290
Hey!

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.350
<i>Yes! Leave this to me!</i>

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:56.290
<i>And me!</i>

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.290
Stop!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.800
<i>Take this!</i>

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:07.430
<i>What a terrifying power...</i>

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:10.150
It even petrified Fantasia itself!

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:12.680
There, you see?! 
There's nothing we can do! Let's run!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.650
<i>Nay!</i>

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:14.970
<i>On Merlin's name...</i>

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:17.060
<i>...this is a worthy opponent for us!</i>

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:20.910
Well, not for me! 
I don't wanna turn into stone!

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:20.490
<i>Attack!</i>

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:22.190
<i>Attack the enemy!</i>

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.970
You're gonna hit a child?!

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:25.960
<i>That's a good point...</i>

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:27.370
<i>That is something we cannot do.</i>

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:29.440
<i>But he's dangerous!</i>

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:32.450
<i>We have no choice 
but to strike him down!</i>

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:34.460
Wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:33.950
<i>Time to move!</i>

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:36.970
Stop!

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:37.970
<i>This should do it!</i>

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:39.460
Seriously, stop!

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.010
<i>Does he have no weak point?</i>

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.790
See? Your attacks aren't working, right?

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:45.460
So it's better to run away!

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:46.860
<i>On Merlin's name...</i>

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:48.470
<i>We shall not retreat!</i>

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.220
These idiots...

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:57.810
<i>Th-This is too cruel! I'm just a kid!</i>

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:00.540
<i>I'm gonna die of stress at this rate!</i>

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:03.610
<i>I'll be buried under all this trouble!</i>

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:07.150
Wait! Stop! I have an idea!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.520
<i>We will not stop now!</i>

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:09.730
I mean it! Stop!

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:10.420
<i>We will not!</i>

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:11.370
In that case...

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:12.940
<i>What?!</i>

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:14.970
<i>H-He's biting us!</i>

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:17.750
I could bite right through 
every last one of you!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:18.650
<i>Gross!</i>

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:20.830
<i>N-No, don't! We'll stop!</i>

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:23.910
<i>He swallowed Lord Arto!</i>

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:24.880
You stopped too suddenly.

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:27.740
<i>I can't believe he swallowed one of us!</i>

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:29.890
<i>O-On Merlin's name...</i>

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.390
<i>It reeks of coffee in here!</i>

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.930
<i>How awful.</i>

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.010
<i>My deepest condolences.</i>

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:41.030
Now, listen to me! 
Don't use concentrated Fantasia attacks!

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:43.020
It won't do any good!

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:46.370
<i>How are we supposed to touch him 
if we don't fight him?</i>

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:48.650
Just don't! Don't touch him!

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:53.160
Instead, release the biggest wave 
of Fantasia you possibly can!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.820
<i>So we do need to attack him?</i>

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:57.410
No! Just release some Fantasia!

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:58.750
<i>That will do nothing!</i>

00:14:58.750 --> 00:14:59.680
<i>I am opposed!</i>

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:01.420
<i>As am I!</i>

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.580
<i>I call for a mutiny, men!</i>

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:04.990
<i>Lord Landlake?</i>

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:06.920
<i>Did you swallow him, too?!</i>

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:10.110
If you don't do as I say, 
I'll swallow all of you!

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:14.930
<i>F-Fine, strange child. 
We will trust in your plan.</i>

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:16.750
You should have in the first place!

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:17.680
Go!

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.180
<i>Right!</i>

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:27.940
Mordred?

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:29.790
We must do something!

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:31.730
Your son is too strong!

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:35.580
He's gone mad! 
Kill him before he slaughters us all!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:39.580
Does he intend to let all the sacrifices 
I've made be for naught?!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.710
Blood on the deck!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:44.830
That's fine wood that 
your lives aren't enough to pay for!

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:48.090
I let you live, 
and you repay me with such resentment?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:52.890
If you're a puppet, 
then do as your master orders you to do!

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.350
You failure of a—

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:59.400
You wretched girl!

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:02.340
You called your own son a puppet?

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:04.480
The deck is more important to you?

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:08.130
Don't be ridiculous!

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:12.610
Enough! Kill her along with my son!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:21.000
Don't you know how much your tainted powers 
have harmed the people?!

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.500
You're the ones 
who don't know anything!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.900
You people need to be controlled!

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:32.730
That's rich, 
with you in that cute little outfit!

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:34.930
You insult me again?!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:41.770
Are you really the same girl 
you were a minute ago?

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:45.580
They're both me!

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:51.030
Pulsar!

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:53.650
<i>He unleashed two arms!</i>

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:56.910
<i>If he stops moving, I'm in trouble!</i>

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:03.790
Come, take my hand!

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:10.150
Who wants to take a dirty hand like that?!

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:13.550
I bet you just want to put a collar 
on me, like I was some animal!

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:15.380
Of course not!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:19.680
You are the ones wasting your time
 resisting like animals!

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.060
Take a look at yourself!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:25.230
The more you resist, 
the more you look like a monster!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.890
What a humorous sight!

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:31.540
<i>He's right.</i>

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:33.210
<i>I have to finish this fast,</i>

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.440
<i>before I lose my senses!</i>

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:38.970
Titan Punch!

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:53.340
Did you expect me to die?

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.430
You nearly had me fooled!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:00.330
You can't win by running away, you know!

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:01.780
Well, then...

00:18:01.780 --> 00:18:03.140
How about this?!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.600
Let's do this, Diabal!

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:08.650
Right!

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:13.730
You never fail to entertain—

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.620
How remarkable!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:25.530
You have given me endless delight!

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:28.750
The more I learn about you, 
the more you surprise me!

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:32.000
Seth!

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.920
Ouch! My nose!

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:41.300
Perhaps I struck a bit too hard.

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:46.380
No, no, no! You should have
evaded that easily!

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:50.400
Are you going to disappoint me, too?

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.540
This is still a mere illusion.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:01.930
Once I know the secret, 
it's no challenge at all!

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:04.870
The Spectre...

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:06.790
Seth...

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:13.790
I see, I see! That was a close one!

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:17.050
Now, hurry and get back on your feet!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.380
Stand and fight back against me!

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:22.670
Come! Come! Come!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:29.770
Is that it? Is that all you can do?!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:36.690
Horned sorcerer, 
I think very highly of your abilities.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:41.700
There are many sorcerers, 
but none have the vitality that you do.

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:45.900
That is why I hoped 
that you would escape.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:51.820
If you don't fight back against me, 
I will grow bored!

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:56.210
Fighting a sorcerer 
is an immense challenge!

00:19:56.210 --> 00:20:01.370
Most people fear your kind, after all.

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:08.230
On my beard, I must protect the people!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:09.310
"Protect"?

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:13.100
You keep saying things 
that sound so noble.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:16.610
They're scared, 
but they want to enslave us.

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:19.610
That's what you wanted, isn't it?!

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.230
Kill them, quickly!

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:26.990
Any infected who do not obey orders 
are no better than garbage!

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.120
You little...

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:32.420
I'm saying I'll give you 
a place to belong!

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:33.740
Why don't you understand?

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:36.560
We'll decide 
where we belong for ourselves!

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:39.130
We have no interest in being your slaves!

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:42.310
Enslave? What complaint 
do you have with that?

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:46.510
You lot are less than human, 
and we're offering to take you in!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:49.260
Less than... human?!

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:52.960
Just look at us!

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:55.470
Even without being infected like you,

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:58.520
we succeeded in obtaining such great power.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:01.420
This is humanity in its purest form!

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:07.160
Are you ready to give up 
and become a slave already?

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:10.450
But that's no fun for me.

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.450
Who's the slave?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.540
What are you talking about?

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:14.300
Between you and me...

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:18.920
which one is really a slave 
to a stupid idea like that?!

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.920
What?!

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:22.930
What's this?

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.670
Gysoni!

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:36.110
You can put chains on us

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:38.560
and put us in cages.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:42.690
We'll just smash our way 
out of them, anyway!

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:46.070
We are infected! We are survivors!

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.320
But we're absolutely not...

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:51.140
...less than human!

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:54.350
We are human!

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:00.850
Ah, what bliss!

00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:05.090
Now, this is the ultimate battle I wanted!

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:11.700
I'm so grateful to have finally found 
a strong opponent like you!

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:14.110
That's not what I'd call a compliment!

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:20.240
Farewell, horned sorcerer!

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:24.850
On my beard!

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.700
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:03.410
<i>Mere moments after powerful Santori's defeat,</i>

00:24:03.410 --> 00:24:08.180
<i>Ullmina drops yet another
 Harmonizium in the forest.</i>

00:24:08.180 --> 00:24:10.560
<i>The Fantasia begins to disappear,</i>

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:13.900
<i>and the revived soldiers 
attack the castle walls.</i>

00:24:14.370 --> 00:24:16.230
<i>Myr loses all hope.</i>

00:24:16.230 --> 00:24:20.020
<i>As sadness turns to rage, 
a resounding howl is heard.</i>

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:24.100
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>, 
"I Can't Hear Your Voice."</i>

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>I Can't Hear Your Voice 
-Myrddin-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
